Release 0.15

- Fixed unnecessary built-in Welcome page insertion when the first visible plugin implements `Welcome` in `existing-user`.
- Reworked the `try_continue` and `next` navigation mechanism.
- Added `PostActAddin` as a dedicated finalization stage:
  - Added `post-act` support to the `existing-user` workflow.
  - Added `post-act` integrations for GNOME Initial Setup and Phrog.
- Added support for merging configuration fragments from `config.d` directories #180:
  - Files are loaded alphabetically.
  - Later fragments override earlier fragments and the main configuration.
- Added vendor CSS support through the `style` option #191.
- Added pulse progress reporting for operations without a known completion percentage.
- Moved `ServiceAddin` into `libready-set`; removed the separate `libready-set-service` library.
- Improved error handling when no visible pages are available or post-act initialization fails.

**Plugins**

- **Network:** (thx @brow)
  - Added WPA Enterprise and 802.1x support !176.
  - Improved the access point security editor and known network handling !181.
  - Added editing of known Wi-Fi networks !176.
  - Updated the integrated GNOME connection editor to version 51 and removed WEP support (PR #179).
  - Added a waiting screen when NetworkManager is unavailable !184.
  - Hostname is now configured directly through D-Bus.
  - Added FQDN support !190.
  - Added automatic hostname generation based on machine ID to avoid collisions !197.
  - Improved Ethernet connection rows and added a “Go Next” arrow !194.
- **Software:**
  - Flatpak source matching now uses the repository URL instead of the local remote name #195:
    - Added the required `repo-url` configuration field.
    - Existing remotes are detected even when they use another name.
    - Name conflicts are resolved by trying `name1`, `name2`, and so on.
    - Invalid Flatpak source configurations are ignored instead of crashing Tuner.
  - Improved software source error handling #177.
- **Date and Time:** (thx @x1z53)
  - Date and time autodetection is shown only when NTP is available !187.
  - Uses the compilation timestamp as the initial value when the system clock is earlier than it !192.
- **Keyboard:**
  - Fixed layout search filtering.
  - Fixed the `enabled` context variable and its initial switch state.
- **User:**
  - An empty password is now reported as `FATALBAD` even when password policy enforcement is disabled.
  - Improved password error messages.
- **License Agreement:** (thx @x1z53)
  - The HTML parser is now used only for files with the `.html` suffix !178.
- **Privacy:**
  - Improved page content margins.

**UI & Resources**

- Improved the Welcome and completion pages.
- Added a compact Welcome page variant.
- Redesigned the installer completion page:
  - Added individual installation stage statuses using the new `InstallerAddin.get_stages()` API.
  - Added determinate and pulse progress indication.
  - Added a reboot action with `login1.CanReboot` validation.
- Repositioned navigation buttons and improved responsive layouts.
- Switched interface actions to symbolic icons !193.
- Fixed opening multiple development windows.

**Integrations**

- Moved GNOME Initial Setup and Phrog files into a dedicated `integrations` directory.
- Added an `existing-user` systemd service for the Phrog integration.

**Documentation & Translations**

- Added Russian README files for the project, plugins, and integrations.
- Updated Russian translation.
